                                         rdfs:seeAlso esco:Relationship,
                                                      esco:location;
                                         rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related>;
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "proposed".
